{
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": "-- Grafana --",
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "description": "Trafic vu par HAProxy, prod et démo : qui nous scanne, qui martèle l'authentification, ce que HAProxy refuse, échecs TLS, latence. Source : lignes HAProxy structurées par Vector (infra/vector/vector.yaml, transform haproxy_journal), label source=\"haproxy\" dans Loki. À importer dans Grafana Cockpit en choisissant la data source Loki.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    {
      "icon": "external link",
      "tags": [],
      "targetBlank": true,
      "title": "Règles d'alerte (docs/ALERTES-GRAFANA.md)",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://github.com/Humanix-Cybersecurity/Humanix-Academie/blob/main/docs/ALERTES-GRAFANA.md"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Trafic : ce qui entre",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requêtes par classe de statut",
      "description": "Toutes les requêtes vues par HAProxy, prod et démo. Un mur de 4xx = balayage ; un mur de 3xx sur edge = redirections HTTP→HTTPS de robots.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (classe) (count_over_time({source=\"haproxy\", type=\"http\", env=~\"$env\"}[$__auto]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{classe}}",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Refus décidés par HAProxy (403 agent bloqué, 405 méthode, 429 abus)",
      "description": "Terminaison PR = requête refusée par une règle HAProxy avant d'atteindre l'application : agents interdits, méthodes exotiques, dépassement des compteurs d'abus (stick table).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (statut) (count_over_time({source=\"haproxy\", type=\"http\", env=~\"$env\"} | json | terminaison =~ \"PR.*\" [$__auto]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{statut}}",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Qui : les adresses",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Adresses IP les plus actives",
      "description": "Sur la plage affichée. Une adresse seule à plus de 1 000 requêtes par jour est presque toujours un robot.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
          },
          "expr": "topk(15, sum by (client_ip) (count_over_time({source=\"haproxy\", type=\"http\", env=~\"$env\"} | json [$__range])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "requêtes",
              "client_ip": "client_ip"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "desc": true,
            "displayName": "requêtes"
          }
        ]
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "filterable": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Adresses IP qui cherchent (404)",
      "description": "Les scanners énumèrent des chemins qui n'existent pas : /.env, /wp-login.php, /geoserver… Le 404 est leur signature.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
          },
          "expr": "topk(15, sum by (client_ip) (count_over_time({source=\"haproxy\", type=\"http\", env=~\"$env\"} | json | statut = 404 [$__range])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "404",
              "client_ip": "client_ip"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "desc": true,
            "displayName": "404"
          }
        ]
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "filterable": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Adresses IP sur l'authentification (POST)",
      "description": "Force brute lente, sous le seuil de 150 requêtes par 10 s de HAProxy. Normal : une personne, quelques POST.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
          },
          "expr": "topk(10, sum by (client_ip) (count_over_time({source=\"haproxy\", type=\"http\", env=~\"$env\"} | json | methode = \"POST\" | chemin =~ \"/api/auth/.*|/connexion.*\" [$__range])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "POST",
              "client_ip": "client_ip"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "desc": true,
            "displayName": "POST"
          }
        ]
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "filterable": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Quoi : les chemins et les volumes",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Chemins sondés sans succès (404)",
      "description": "Les paramètres de requête sont retirés avant l'envoi à Loki : un chemin /api/auth/callback apparaît sans son code.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
          },
          "expr": "topk(20, sum by (chemin) (count_over_time({source=\"haproxy\", type=\"http\", env=~\"$env\"} | json | statut = 404 [$__range])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "404",
